msgstr "来电号码已隐藏。"
msgid "Capability and service"
msgstr "能力与服务"
msgid "Credentials configured. Registration is not reported by v1 status."
msgstr "凭据已配置。v1 状态不报告注册状态。"
msgid "DTMF is reserved for a future media contract."
msgstr "DTMF 控制保留给后续媒体协议。"
