msgstr "媒体能力已就绪；浏览器连接需要主动启用。"
msgid "Microphone permission was denied. Allow it in the browser and try again."
msgstr "麦克风权限被拒绝。请在浏览器中允许后重试。"
msgid "Mute"
msgstr "静音"
