msgstr "正在恢复状态。正在刷新通话快照。"
msgid "Supported"
msgstr "支持"
msgid "The call changed state before this command completed."
msgstr "命令完成前通话状态已变化。"
msgid "The destination contains unsupported characters."
msgstr "目标包含不支持的字符。"
msgid "The modem call command failed."
msgstr "调制解调器通话命令失败。"
msgid "The modem could not restore its baseline state."
msgstr "调制解调器无法恢复基线状态。"
msgid "The operation failed."
msgstr "操作失败。"
msgid "The read-only hardware probe did not pass. Call controls stay unavailable."
msgstr "只读硬件探测未通过。通话控制保持不可用。"
msgid "This call endpoint is not available."
msgstr "此通话端点不可用。"
