msgstr "硬件不支持：通话控制不可用。"
msgid "Unsupported hardware fails closed. This page controls one modem call."
msgstr "不支持的硬件将安全关闭。本页面仅控制一个调制解调器通话。"
msgid "Username"
msgstr "用户名"
msgid "Use digits and the modem-supported call control characters."
msgstr "请输入数字和调制解调器支持的通话控制字符。"
msgid "Write-only. The password is cleared after each attempt."
msgstr "仅可写入。每次尝试后都会清除密码。"
